  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/titles/sleep.png\" alt=\"minecraft 數據包標題…\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/z2n3qTzQY6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/Discord.png\" alt=\"jodeks discord - discord 徽章 - 像素徽章 - 像素 discord 徽章 - jodeks 數據包 - 數據包 discord\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/YouTube.png\" alt=\"數據包 jodek youtube\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/sleep/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/GH_Issues.png\" alt=\"盔甲架手臂 minecraft 數據包 github 問題\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/Kofi.png\" alt=\"jodeks 數據包 kofi - jodek kofi - minecraft 數據包 kofi 捐贈\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/Jodekq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/GH_Sponsor.png\" alt=\"github 贊助商 jodek 捐贈 數據包 minecraft\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/blob/main/gifs/sleep-skip-time-warp-night-to-day.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"sleep 跳過夜晚 改變跳過夜晚所需的玩家數量 minecraft 睡覺\"></p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<p><strong>1.</strong> 正在睡覺的玩家會顯示在快捷欄上方</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong> 在配置文件中更改需要多少名玩家睡覺才能跳過夜晚 --&gt; 默認值 = 1</p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong> 使用配置文件配置大量與睡覺相關的內容</p>\n<p><strong>4.</strong> 配合我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsleep-anytime-you-want\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">隨時隨地睡覺</a> 數據包/模組，你可以在一天中的任何時間睡覺</p>\n<p><strong>5.</strong> 與我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fafk-announcer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AFK 廣播器</a> 數據包/模組兼容，這樣離線（AFK）的玩家就不需要睡覺來跳過夜晚（你可以通過配置文件更改此設置）</p>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aeb01f99d34880e1fa6cf637c6e06f233a0cbcf1.png\" alt=\"一名玩家正在睡覺\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a175cc59a3b9ef91fb5e13b2ea8f17dd345f3a1b.png\" alt=\"兩名玩家正在睡覺\"></p>\n<h2>配置文件</h2>\n<p>運行：</p>\n<pre><code>/trigger sleep.config</code></pre>",
